mode: "100644"
text: "# Magnet menu, funnel + two worked examples\n\n## Stage-matched magnet menu\n| Goal | Best magnet | Format note |\n|---|---|---|\n| Want emails fast (top) | quiz, AI generator, calculator, checklist | low friction, instant result, shareable |\n| Better-qualified (mid) | assessment, scorecard, template, benchmark report | surfaces intent + data to segment |\n| Book calls/demos (bottom) | audit, grader, ROI/savings calculator | shows a gap you can close |\n| Grow audience | shareable quiz or template | spreads naturally |\nDefault when torn: the format that gives an **instant, personalised result** (interactive wins). Templates\nconvert best when **specific-task + workflow-tied + industry-specific**.\n\n## Funnel architecture (map before building)\n```\nPROMO POST (WoopSocial publishes) -> LANDING (benefit-first headline, 1 promise, trust marker, short form)\n-> SUCCESS PAGE (access + what's next) -> DELIVERY EMAIL (resend asset, set expectations) -> NURTURE (3-5)\n```\nForm = **email (or +first name) only**. Test the whole path on mobile + desktop; small gaps = big leaks.\n\n## Nurture sequence template (value-first, 3-5)\n```\n1 DELIVER: the asset + how to use it in 5 min (set expectations)\n2 QUICK WIN: one specific result they can get today (reference what they came for)\n3 PROOF: a short case/social proof that the approach works\n4 SOFT NEXT STEP: invite the next step toward the offer (only now)\n5 (optional) RECOVERY: gentle re-offer / branch for non-openers\n```\n**Branch on behavior:** clicked pricing -> a different track than opened-once-went-quiet.\n\n## Worked example 1 — calculator funnel (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nAUDIENCE/PROBLEM: freelancers unsure what to charge. MAGNET: \"Freelance Rate Calculator - see your number in 60s\" (instant result, top-funnel).\nOFFER LINK: connects to a paid pricing course. FUNNEL: landing -> email-only form -> result page -> delivery -> 4-email nurture.\nPROMO: \"Comment RATE or grab it in bio.\" (WoopSocial publishes) CAPTURE: link-in-bio + comment->DM. METRICS: builder + GA4.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — quiz to qualify (warm studio voice)\n```\nMAGNET: \"What's leaking money in your bookkeeping?\" 6-question quiz -> tailored 3-step result (mid-funnel, qualifies).\nNURTURE: deliver result -> one quick win for their result type -> a client proof point -> soft invite to a free 15-min review.\nBRANCH: \"needs cleanup now\" result -> faster invite; \"just curious\" -> more value first. TOOLS: quiz builder + ESP (external). -> email-and-newsletter\n```\n\nBoth: one audience/one problem/one quick win; instant interactive result; tied to the offer; whole funnel\ndesigned; behavior-branched nurture; WoopSocial only publishes the promo posts; metrics from external\ntools + GA4 (never fabricated); no dark patterns.\n"
